@startuml culture-organization-boundary
title Culture / Organization Boundary ; per ADR-ES-026 section 6 + Recon-ES-003

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Culture" as Cult
class "Organization" as Org

Cult --> Org : supports
Org ..> Cult : is shaped by

note right of Cult
  Per Recon-ES-003:
  Culture concerns shared organizational meaning,
  norms, values, and behavioral conventions.
  Organization concerns coordinated entity structure.

  Culture is NOT Organization.
  Organization is NOT Culture.
end note

@enduml
